<title>USA: Commerce Bancorp raises annual cash div.</title>
<headline>Commerce Bancorp raises annual cash div.</headline>
<dateline>CHERRY HILL, N.J. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Bancorp Inc said on Thursday it would increase its annual cash dividend by 14 percent to $0.80 per share, up from $0.70 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the increase reflects 1996 earnings progress and &quot;shows our confidence in earnings prospects for 1997.&quot;  </p>
<p>The quarterly dividend of 20 cents is payable on January 21 to shareholders of record on January 8, the company said. It was raised from $0.175 per share.</p>
</text>
